      {
       "data": "Out[1047]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{state \\{$\\mu$, copy\\}} & \\text{K\\_ref insertion} & \\text{$\\rho$ = K\\_ref/S\\_ref (t = 5/2)} & \\text{max |lead($\\varepsilon$0) - lead($\\varepsilon$0/2)|} & \\text{accuracy (digits)}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{8,1,1\\right\\},1\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,3\\right\\} & 5.00725\\times 10^{-25} & 9.51\\times 10^{-25} & 194\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{7,3,0\\right\\},1\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,3\\right\\} & 5.07961\\times 10^{-27} & 7.05\\times 10^{-25} & 193\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{7,2,1\\right\\},1\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,3\\right\\} & 2.25641\\times 10^{-28} & 3.68\\times 10^{-25} & 195\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{7,2,1\\right\\},2\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,3\\right\\} & -1.97396\\times 10^{-26} & 2.83\\times 10^{-25} & 194\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{6,4,0\\right\\},1\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,3\\right\\} & 0.25 & 4.74\\times 10^{-26} & 202\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{6,3,1\\right\\},1\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,3\\right\\} & 0.148431 & 3.36\\times 10^{-25} & 198\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{6,3,1\\right\\},2\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,3\\right\\} & 0.271974 & 1.35\\times 10^{-25} & 199\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{6,2,2\\right\\},1\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,3\\right\\} & -0.285714 & 3.06\\times 10^{-25} & 190\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{5,5,0\\right\\},1\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,3\\right\\} & 2.625 & 6.07\\times 10… [latex truncated: 1764 chars total]",
