   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3b. Re-display of Sections 2–3 from the kernel state\nThe data cell (Section 2) ran for 1059 s. Its own display, and that of Section 3, timed out in the MCP channel, so the outputs shown above are stale. This cell redraws the tables from the computed `fits1`, `fits2` and `discForm` without recomputing anything.",
